<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50"><TXSPN>-sama, we are still partway through the Wabigoto Arc [Apology], but I would like to talk with you for just a little while.<PG>
The past of Mifuyu Niimura, who committed murder as the shinigami in the world of Shiyo 800―it seems to stem from her taking Haruka Niimura in as her adopted daughter.<PG>
What do you think? Can you guess how that ties in with the incident of Shiyo 800?
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
